', 'description': 'Calculate moving averages (MA5/10/20/30/60/120/250 or custom periods) for a stock. Returns each MA value, price bias %, and whether price is above each MA. Also returns overall MA alignment (多头/空头/混合).', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'periods': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Comma-separated MA periods to calculate (default: '5,10,20,30,60,120,250'). E.g., '5,10,20,60'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of trading days to fetch history for (default: 120)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}, {'name': 'get_volume_analysis', 'description': 'Analyse volume-price relationship for a stock. Returns volume ratios, average volume on up vs down days, volume trend (expanding/shrinking), and pattern interpretation (量价配合/背离). Useful for confirming trend strength and detecting distribution or accumulation phases.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of recent trading days to analyse (default: 30)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}, {'name': 'analyze_pattern', 'description': 'Detect candlestick and chart patterns in recent price history. Identifies: Doji, Hammer, Shooting Star, Morning/Evening Star, Engulfing, Double Bottom, upward breakout, box oscillation, and more. Returns pattern list with type (bullish/bearish/reversal) and strength.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of recent trading days to scan (default: 60)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}, {'name': 'search_stock_news', 'description': 'Search for the latest news articles about a specific stock. Requires both stock_code and stock_name for accurate search. Returns news titles, snippets, sources, and URLs.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'stock_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock name in Chinese, e.g., '贵州茅台'"}}, 'required': ['stock_code', 'stock_name']}}, {'name': 'search_comprehensive_intel', 'description': 'Multi-dimensional intelligence search: latest news, market analysis, risk checking, earnings outlook, and industry trends for a stock. Returns a formatted report and structured results.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519'"}, 'stock_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock name in Chinese, e.g., '贵州茅台'"}}, 'required': ['stock_code', 'stock_name']}}, {'name': 'get_market_indices', 'description': 'Get major market indices (e.g., Shanghai Composite, Shenzhen Component, CSI 300 for China; S&P 500, Nasdaq, Dow for US). Provides market overview.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'region': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Market region: 'cn' for China A-shares, 'us' for US stocks (default: 'cn')", 'enum': ['cn', 'us']}}}}, {'name': 'get_sector_rankings', 'description': 'Get sector/industry performance rankings. Returns top N and bottom N sectors by daily change percentage. Useful for sector rotation analysis.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'top_n': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Number of top/bottom sectors to return (default: 10)'}}}}, {'name': 'get_strategy_backtest_summary', 'description': 'Get overall strategy backtest performance summary (win rate, direction accuracy, avg return, stop-loss/take-profit trigger rates). Read-only, does not trigger new backtests.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'eval_window_days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Evaluation window in days (default: 30). How many trading days after signal to evaluate.'}}}}, {'name': 'get_stock_backtest_summary', 'description': 'Get backtest performance data for a specific stock: per-stock summary (win rate, accuracy, avg return) plus recent evaluation records. Read-only, does not trigger new backtests.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'stock_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Stock code, e.g., '600519' (A-share), 'AAPL' (US), 'hk00700' (HK)"}, 'eval_window_days': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Evaluation window in days (default: 30)'}, 'limit': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Max number of recent evaluation records to return (default: 10)'}}, 'required': ['stock_code']}}]}], 'generationConfig': {'temperature': 0.7}}'
